From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Leventov <leventov.ru@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 11 Jul 2026 14:04:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/29] isolate: make HTTP action context reuse optional

Add an opt-in cache for evaluated HTTP-action V8 contexts keyed by component module path. Reinstall fresh request-owned state for every invocation, validate saved initialization reads before reuse, and discard contexts after execution errors, termination, pending task promises, or incompatible request state.

Reset request byte accounting across reuse and preserve module/global state only behind REUSE_HTTP_ACTION_CONTEXTS. Document semantics, invalidation, memory shape, observability interaction, measured impact, and rollback in patches/reuse_http_action_contexts/README.md.
